  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">United Nations Office for Project Services (UNOPS) Humanitarian Support to Gaza</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This investment funds Australia&#x2019;s partnership agreement with the United Nations Office for Project Services (UNOPS) to provide humanitarian support to Gaza. It includes support for UNOPS&#x2019;s Project Management Unit and the Access Coordination Unit to safeguard the movement of humanitarian supplies into Gaza.</narrative>
